  {
   "id": 22,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    -1020,
    0
   ],
   "size": [
    460,
    560
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 21,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 13 - High-resolution image / video enhancement (tiled)\n\n**Models** (official Comfy-Org files; the loaders carry their download links): ref2va, Qwen3-VL, video + audio VAE.\n\n**Checkpoint variants**: the bf16 checkpoints work in the same loaders (pick them in the list); the Turbo LoRA (4-step ref2v / 8-step fl2v) cuts the steps - set the scheduler steps to match.\n\n**Inputs**: a video (a still: one-frame batch through the same path); the target size on Upscale Image.\n\n**Controls**: the source is upscaled, encoded (Inject Video Latent) and re-sampled at denoise 0.35 in tiles (H3 Split Upscale: spatial tiles 768 px with 25% overlap, temporal chunks of 73 frames with 22 overlap, seam polish, colour match); the low-resolution source rides along as <Video 1> so content stays put; Prompt Writer's upscale_incontext template (no LLM).\n\n**Output**: the enhanced video at the target size with the source sound, MP4.\n\n**Limits**: denoise above ~0.5 invents detail; the target size should be on the 32 px grid (1920x1088, not 1080); tiling numbers are starting values - quality on H3 weights not measured here.\n\n**Status**: built in ComfyUI's own front end and validated by the server (only missing model / media files reported). NOT run on H3 weights on the build machine - starting values follow core's H3 templates (res_multistep, simple, 20 steps, guider cfg 1). Guide: workflows/tasks/README.md."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# 13 - High-resolution image / video enhancement (tiled)\n\n**Models** (official Comfy-Org files; the loaders carry their download links): ref2va, Qwen3-VL, video + audio VAE.\n\n**Checkpoint variants**: the bf16 checkpoints work in the same loaders (pick them in the list); the Turbo LoRA (4-step ref2v / 8-step fl2v) cuts the steps - set the scheduler steps to match.\n\n**Inputs**: a video (a still: one-frame batch through the same path); the target size on Upscale Image.\n\n**Controls**: the source is upscaled, encoded (Inject Video Latent) and re-sampled at denoise 0.35 in tiles (H3 Split Upscale: spatial tiles 768 px with 25% overlap, temporal chunks of 73 frames with 22 overlap, seam polish, colour match); the low-resolution source rides along as <Video 1> so content stays put; Prompt Writer's upscale_incontext template (no LLM).\n\n**Output**: the enhanced video at the target size with the source sound, MP4.\n\n**Limits**: denoise above ~0.5 invents detail; the target size should be on the 32 px grid (1920x1088, not 1080); tiling numbers are starting values - quality on H3 weights not measured here.\n\n**Status**: built in ComfyUI's own front end and validated by the server (only missing model / media files reported). NOT run on H3 weights on the build machine - starting values follow core's H3 templates (res_multistep, simple, 20 steps, guider cfg 1). Guide: workflows/tasks/README.md."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
